  "description": "../description.md",
  "install_text": "**SM-3EGW**\n\nThree-phase energy meter with WiFi, Ethernet, and GSM connectivity.\n\n**Measured Parameters**\n- Voltage (V) — phases A, B, C\n- Current (A) — phases A, B, C and total\n- Active/Reactive/Apparent Power — phases A, B, C and total\n- Power Factor — phases A, B, C and total\n- Phase Angle (°) — per phase\n- Frequency (Hz)\n- Active Energy Consumption/Generation (kWh)\n- Reactive Energy Consumption/Generation (kVArh)\n- Energy Delta — difference between telemetries\n- Voltage Phase Angles (°) — A-B, A-C, B-C\n- Device Temperature (°C)\n- Connection Type (WiFi/Ethernet/GSM)\n- Wi-Fi and GSM Signal Strength (dBm)\n\nThe device transmits a JSON object with 67 fields. All values are sent as strings.",
